{"t":"sonar","cat":"haditengerészet","hu":"szonár, hanglokátor","en":"a system using sound waves to detect and locate objects underwater","ex":"The sonar operator picked up a faint contact bearing north-east.","abbr":"sound navigation and ranging","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A szonárkezelő halvány kontaktust észlelt észak-keleti irányban."},
{"t":"starboard","cat":"haditengerészet","hu":"jobb oldal (hajón), jobb hajóoldal","en":"the right-hand side of a ship when facing forward","ex":"The captain ordered a hard turn to starboard to avoid the mine.","abbr":"stbd","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A kapitány éles jobbra fordulást rendelt el az akna elkerülésére."},
{"t":"stern","cat":"haditengerészet","hu":"hajófar, tat","en":"the rear end of a ship","ex":"The helicopter landed on the deck near the stern.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A helikopter a fedélzeten szállt le, a hajófar közelében."},
{"t":"submarine","cat":"haditengerészet","hu":"tengeralattjáró","en":"a warship capable of operating fully submerged for long periods","ex":"The submarine slipped out of port under cover of darkness.","abbr":"sub / SSN / SSK","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A tengeralattjáró a sötétség leple alatt osont ki a kikötőből."},
{"t":"torpedo","cat":"haditengerészet","hu":"torpedó","en":"a self-propelled underwater missile launched from a submarine, ship or aircraft","ex":"The submarine fired two torpedoes at the tanker before diving.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A tengeralattjáró két torpedót lőtt ki a tartályhajóra, mielőtt alámerült."},
{"t":"aerial refuelling","cat":"légierő","hu":"légi utántöltés","en":"transferring fuel from a tanker aircraft to another aircraft in flight","ex":"Aerial refuelling allowed the fighters to stay on station for six hours.","abbr":"AAR / air-to-air refuelling","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A légi utántöltés lehetővé tette, hogy a vadászgépek hat órán át a kijelölt légtérben maradjanak."},
{"t":"air marshal","cat":"légierő","hu":"altábornagy (légierő, brit)","en":"a senior RAF air officer rank equivalent to a lieutenant general","ex":"The air marshal oversaw the entire air campaign from the joint headquarters.","abbr":"AM","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az altábornagy a haderőnemi közös főhadiszállásról felügyelte a teljes légi hadjáratot."},
{"t":"airlift","cat":"légierő","hu":"légi szállítás, légihíd","en":"the transport of troops and supplies by aircraft, especially in an emergency","ex":"An airlift delivered food and medicine to the besieged city.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Egy légi szállítás élelmiszert és gyógyszert juttatott el az ostromlott városba."},
{"t":"airspace","cat":"légierő","hu":"légtér","en":"the portion of the atmosphere controlled by a country above its territory","ex":"The aircraft violated the country's airspace for less than a minute.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A repülőgép kevesebb mint egy percre megsértette az ország légterét."},
{"t":"anti-aircraft","cat":"légierő","hu":"légvédelmi, légelhárító","en":"designed to defend against attack by hostile aircraft","ex":"Anti-aircraft fire lit up the sky over the capital.","abbr":"AA / AAA (anti-aircraft artillery)","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A légvédelmi tűz kivilágította az eget a főváros felett."},
{"t":"bomber","cat":"légierő","hu":"bombázó repülőgép","en":"a military aircraft designed to attack ground and naval targets with bombs","ex":"The heavy bombers struck the airfield from high altitude.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A nehézbombázók nagy magasságból csaptak le a repülőtérre."},
{"t":"dogfight","cat":"légierő","hu":"légi közelharc, légiharc","en":"close-range aerial combat between fighter aircraft","ex":"The dogfight lasted barely two minutes before the enemy pilot ejected.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A légi közelharc alig két percig tartott, mielőtt az ellenséges pilóta katapultált."},
{"t":"ejection seat","cat":"légierő","hu":"katapultülés","en":"a seat that fires the pilot clear of the aircraft in an emergency","ex":"The pilot survived thanks to the ejection seat, suffering only minor injuries.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A pilóta a katapultülésnek köszönhetően túlélte, csak kisebb sérüléseket szenvedett."},
{"t":"fighter","cat":"légierő","hu":"vadászrepülőgép","en":"a military aircraft designed primarily for air-to-air combat","ex":"The fighters climbed to escort the bombers across the border.","abbr":"fighter jet","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A vadászgépek felemelkedtek, hogy a határon át kísérjék a bombázókat."},
{"t":"flight lieutenant","cat":"légierő","hu":"százados (légierő, brit)","en":"a junior officer rank in the RAF, equivalent to an army captain","ex":"The flight lieutenant led the four-ship formation on its first combat mission.","abbr":"Flt Lt","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A százados vezette a négygépes köteléket az első bevetésén."},
{"t":"hangar","cat":"légierő","hu":"hangár","en":"a large building in which aircraft are kept and maintained","ex":"The ground crew towed the damaged jet back into the hangar.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A földi kiszolgáló személyzet visszavontatta a sérült gépet a hangárba."},
{"t":"interceptor","cat":"légierő","hu":"elfogó vadászrepülőgép","en":"a fast fighter aircraft designed to detect and destroy enemy aircraft approaching friendly airspace","ex":"Two interceptors were launched to identify the unresponsive airliner.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Két elfogó vadászgépet indítottak, hogy azonosítsák a nem válaszoló utasszállítót."},
{"t":"no-fly zone","cat":"légierő","hu":"repüléstilalmi övezet","en":"an area over which aircraft are not permitted to fly, usually enforced militarily","ex":"Coalition jets patrolled the no-fly zone around the clock.","abbr":"NFZ","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A koalíciós gépek éjjel-nappal járőröztek a repüléstilalmi övezetben."},
{"t":"payload","cat":"légierő","hu":"hasznos teher, harci terhelés","en":"the weapons, cargo or equipment carried by an aircraft or missile","ex":"The bomber can carry a payload of over twenty tonnes.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A bombázó több mint húsz tonna hasznos terhet képes szállítani."},
{"t":"runway","cat":"légierő","hu":"kifutópálya, felszállópálya","en":"a paved strip on which aircraft take off and land","ex":"Cratering the runway kept the enemy air base out of action for days.","abbr":"RWY","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A kifutópálya megrongálása napokra harcképtelenné tette az ellenséges légibázist."},
{"t":"scramble","cat":"légierő","hu":"riasztott felszállás, riadó-felszállás","en":"an emergency take-off of fighter aircraft in response to a threat","ex":"The alert crews were ordered to scramble when the radar picked up unidentified aircraft.","abbr":"QRA scramble","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A készenléti személyzetet riasztott felszállásra utasították, amikor a radar azonosítatlan repülőgépet észlelt."},
{"t":"sortie","cat":"légierő","hu":"bevetés (egy repülőgép egyszeri felszállása)","en":"a single operational flight by one military aircraft","ex":"The squadron flew forty sorties in the first twenty-four hours of the campaign.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A század negyven bevetést repült a hadjárat első huszonnégy órájában."},
{"t":"squadron","cat":"légierő","hu":"repülőszázad","en":"the basic operational unit of an air force, typically of twelve to twenty-four aircraft","ex":"The squadron deployed to the forward air base with sixteen aircraft.","abbr":"Sqn","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A repülőszázad tizenhat géppel települt az előretolt légibázisra."},
{"t":"squadron leader","cat":"légierő","hu":"őrnagy (légierő, brit)","en":"an RAF officer rank equivalent to an army major, typically commanding a flight","ex":"The squadron leader briefed the pilots on the target and the weather.","abbr":"Sqn Ldr","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az őrnagy eligazította a pilótákat a célpontról és az időjárásról."},
{"t":"surface-to-air missile","cat":"légierő","hu":"föld-levegő rakéta, légvédelmi rakéta","en":"a missile launched from the ground or a ship to destroy aircraft or missiles","ex":"A surface-to-air missile brought down the helicopter shortly after take-off.","abbr":"SAM","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Egy föld-levegő rakéta rövidesen a felszállás után lelőtte a helikoptert."},
{"t":"wing","cat":"légierő","hu":"repülőezred, repülőosztály","en":"an air force formation made up of several squadrons","ex":"The wing brought together three squadrons for the exercise.","abbr":"Wg","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A repülőezred három századot vont össze a gyakorlatra."},
{"t":"wing commander","cat":"légierő","hu":"alezredes (légierő, brit)","en":"an RAF officer rank equivalent to lieutenant colonel, usually commanding a squadron","ex":"The wing commander grounded the squadron until the fault was found.","abbr":"Wg Cdr","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az alezredes repülési tilalmat rendelt el a századnak, amíg meg nem találták a hibát."},
{"t":"wingman","cat":"légierő","hu":"kísérő pilóta, kísérőgép","en":"a pilot who flies alongside and supports the lead aircraft in a formation","ex":"His wingman covered him as he broke off to engage the target.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A kísérő pilótája fedezte, miközben ő leszakadt, hogy megtámadja a célpontot."},
{"t":"classified","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"minősített (adat), titkos","en":"officially designated as secret and restricted to authorised persons","ex":"The report remains classified and cannot be released to the press.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A jelentés továbbra is minősített, és nem hozható nyilvánosságra a sajtó számára."},
{"t":"cover","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"fedés, fedőtörténet, fedőfoglalkozás","en":"a false identity or occupation that conceals an agent's true role","ex":"His cover as a trade attaché allowed him to travel freely.","abbr":"cover story","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Kereskedelmi attaséi fedése lehetővé tette számára, hogy szabadon utazzon."},
{"t":"dead drop","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"rejtekhely, \"halott postaláda\"","en":"a secret location where items are left for another person without a face-to-face meeting","ex":"The microfilm was left in a dead drop beneath a park bench.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A mikrofilmet egy park padja alatti rejtekhelyen (\"halott postaládában\") hagyták."},
{"t":"debrief","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"kikérdezés, jelentéstétel (bevetés vagy küldetés után)","en":"to question someone in detail about a completed mission or experience","ex":"Intelligence officers debriefed the returning pilots for two hours.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A hírszerzőtisztek két órán át hallgatták ki a visszatérő pilótákat."},
{"t":"defector","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"átálló, disszidens, szökevény","en":"a person who abandons their country or cause, often bringing secrets to the other side","ex":"The defector provided detailed knowledge of the missile programme.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az átálló részletes ismereteket szolgáltatott a rakétaprogramról."},
{"t":"encryption","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"titkosítás, rejtjelezés","en":"the process of converting information into code to prevent unauthorised access","ex":"All operational orders are transmitted using military-grade encryption.","abbr":"crypto","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Minden hadműveleti parancsot katonai szintű titkosítással továbbítanak."},
{"t":"handler","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"tartótiszt, összekötő tiszt","en":"an intelligence officer who directs and supports an agent or informant","ex":"The handler met his source only in crowded public places.","abbr":"case officer","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A tartótiszt csak zsúfolt nyilvános helyeken találkozott a forrásával."},
{"t":"informant","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"informátor, besúgó","en":"a person who secretly provides information to an intelligence or security service","ex":"An informant tipped off the police hours before the planned attack.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Egy informátor órákkal a tervezett támadás előtt figyelmeztette a rendőrséget."},
{"t":"intelligence","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"hírszerzés; felderítési információ","en":"information about an enemy or potential enemy gathered and analysed for military use","ex":"Intelligence suggested the enemy was preparing to withdraw from the town.","abbr":"int / intel","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A hírszerzési információk arra utaltak, hogy az ellenség készül kivonulni a városból."},
{"t":"interrogation","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"kihallgatás","en":"the formal and systematic questioning of a prisoner or suspect","ex":"The interrogation of the captured officer yielded useful details about supply routes.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az elfogott tiszt kihallgatása hasznos részleteket tárt fel az utánpótlási útvonalakról."},
{"t":"leak","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"kiszivárogtatás, kiszivárgás","en":"the unauthorised disclosure of secret information","ex":"The leak of the memo caused a diplomatic incident.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A feljegyzés kiszivárgása diplomáciai incidenst okozott."},
{"t":"mole","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"beépített ügynök, \"tégla\", vakond","en":"a spy who works inside an organisation while secretly serving a hostile service","ex":"The mole had passed secrets to the enemy for over a decade.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A beépített ügynök (\"tégla\") több mint egy évtizeden át adott át titkokat az ellenségnek."},
{"t":"surveillance","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"megfigyelés, figyelés","en":"close observation of a person, place or activity, often covertly","ex":"The suspect had been under surveillance for six weeks before his arrest.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A gyanúsított hat héten át állt megfigyelés alatt a letartóztatása előtt."},
{"t":"top secret","cat":"hírszerzés","hu":"szigorúan titkos","en":"the highest level of security classification for information","ex":"Only a handful of officials had access to the top secret plans.","abbr":"TS","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Csak néhány tisztviselőnek volt hozzáférése a szigorúan titkos tervekhez."},
{"t":"blast injury","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"robbanásos sérülés","en":"trauma caused by the pressure wave, fragments or heat of an explosion","ex":"Blast injuries to the lungs often show no external signs at first.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A tüdőt ért robbanásos sérülések gyakran nem mutatnak külső jeleket eleinte."},
{"t":"casualty","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"sérült, sebesült; veszteség","en":"a person killed or injured in war or an accident","ex":"The unit suffered three casualties during the ambush.","abbr":"cas","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az alakulat három sérültet vesztett a rajtaütés során."},
{"t":"combat medic","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"harctéri egészségügyi katona, szanitéc","en":"a soldier trained to give emergency medical treatment on the battlefield","ex":"The combat medic reached the wounded soldier under heavy fire.","abbr":"medic","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A harctéri szanitéc erős tűz alatt jutott el a sebesült katonához."},
{"t":"concussion","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"agyrázkódás","en":"a temporary brain injury caused by a blow or blast affecting consciousness or function","ex":"The soldier was diagnosed with a concussion after the vehicle hit a mine.","abbr":"mild traumatic brain injury (mTBI)","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A katonánál agyrázkódást diagnosztizáltak, miután a járműve aknára futott."},
{"t":"field hospital","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"tábori kórház","en":"a temporary hospital set up near a combat zone to treat casualties","ex":"The field hospital treated over two hundred casualties in its first week.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A tábori kórház első hetében kétszáznál is több sérültet látott el."},
{"t":"first aid kit","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"elsősegélycsomag, egyéni sebkötöző csomag","en":"a pack of basic medical supplies carried for immediate treatment of injuries","ex":"Every soldier carries an individual first aid kit on the front of the body armour.","abbr":"IFAK","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Minden katona egyéni sebkötöző csomagot visel a golyóálló mellény elején."},
{"t":"golden hour","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"\"aranyóra\" (a sérülés utáni első óra)","en":"the first hour after severe injury, during which treatment is most likely to save life","ex":"Helicopter evacuation is designed to get casualties to surgery within the golden hour.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A helikopteres kimentés célja, hogy a sérültek az \"aranyórán\" belül műtétre kerüljenek."},
{"t":"haemorrhage","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"vérzés, erős vérzés","en":"severe, often life-threatening bleeding","ex":"Controlling the haemorrhage is the first priority in battlefield care.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A vérzés elállítása az első prioritás a harctéri ellátásban."},
{"t":"litter","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"hordágy (amerikai szóhasználat)","en":"a stretcher for carrying casualties, especially in US military usage","ex":"The helicopter can carry six litter patients and four seated casualties.","abbr":"stretcher (UK)","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A helikopter hat fekvő (hordágyas) sérültet és négy ülő sebesültet tud szállítani."},
{"t":"medical evacuation","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"egészségügyi kiürítés, sérültszállítás","en":"the transport of casualties to medical facilities under medical care, often by helicopter","ex":"Medical evacuation by helicopter arrived twenty minutes after the call.","abbr":"MEDEVAC","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A helikopteres egészségügyi kiürítés húsz perccel a bejelentés után érkezett meg."},
{"t":"morphine","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"morfin","en":"a strong painkilling drug given to seriously wounded casualties","ex":"The medic administered morphine and marked the dose on the casualty's forehead.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A szanitéc morfint adott be, és a homlokára írta fel a dózist a sérültnek."},
{"t":"post-traumatic stress disorder","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"poszttraumás stressz-zavar","en":"a mental health condition triggered by experiencing or witnessing traumatic events","ex":"Many veterans struggle with post-traumatic stress disorder years after coming home.","abbr":"PTSD","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Sok veterán évekkel a hazatérése után is küzd a poszttraumás stressz-zavarral."},
{"t":"shrapnel wound","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"repeszsérülés","en":"an injury caused by fragments from an exploding shell, bomb or grenade","ex":"He was treated for shrapnel wounds to the arm and shoulder.","abbr":"fragmentation wound","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A karján és a vállán szenvedett repeszsérüléseket kezelték."},
{"t":"sick bay","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"gyengélkedő, hajóorvosi rendelő","en":"a room on a ship or base where sick or injured personnel are treated","ex":"The sailor spent two days in the sick bay with a fever.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A tengerész két napot töltött lázasan a gyengélkedőn."},
{"t":"stretcher","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"hordágy","en":"a portable frame used to carry a sick or injured person","ex":"Four soldiers carried the stretcher across the open ground at a run.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Négy katona futva vitte át a hordágyat a nyílt terepen."},
{"t":"tourniquet","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"érszorító","en":"a tight band applied to a limb to stop severe bleeding","ex":"A tourniquet applied within minutes saved the soldier's leg and life.","abbr":"TQ / CAT","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A perceken belül felhelyezett érszorító megmentette a katona lábát és életét."},
{"t":"triage","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"sérültosztályozás, triázs","en":"sorting casualties by urgency to decide the order of treatment","ex":"Triage at the aid post determined who would be evacuated first.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A segélyhelyen végzett sérültosztályozás döntötte el, kit szállítanak el elsőként."},
{"t":"walking wounded","cat":"egészségügy","hu":"járóképes sebesült","en":"injured persons who are still able to walk and need no stretcher","ex":"The walking wounded were told to make their own way to the aid station.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A járóképes sebesülteket utasították, hogy önerőből jussanak el a segélyhelyre."},
{"t":"back bearing","cat":"navigáció","hu":"ellenirányszög","en":"a bearing in the opposite direction, obtained by adding or subtracting 180 degrees","ex":"Use a back bearing to check that you have not drifted off the track.","abbr":"reciprocal bearing","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Használj ellenirányszöget annak ellenőrzésére, hogy nem tértél-e le az útvonalról."},
{"t":"bearing","cat":"navigáció","hu":"irányszög, azimut","en":"the horizontal angle from north to the direction of an object, measured clockwise in degrees or mils","ex":"Take a bearing on the church spire and walk that line for 400 metres.","abbr":"azimuth","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Vegyél irányszöget a templomtoronyra, és haladj azon a vonalon 400 métert."},
{"t":"choke point","cat":"navigáció","hu":"szűkület, terepszoros","en":"a narrow passage that restricts movement and forces troops to bunch up","ex":"The mountain pass was a natural choke point where a small force could halt a column.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A hegyszoros természetes szűkület volt, ahol egy kis erő is fel tudott tartóztatni egy oszlopot."},
{"t":"compass","cat":"navigáció","hu":"tájoló, iránytű","en":"an instrument with a magnetised needle used for finding direction","ex":"With the GPS dead, the patrol navigated by compass and map alone.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A GPS meghibásodása után a járőr kizárólag tájoló és térkép segítségével navigált."},
{"t":"contour line","cat":"navigáció","hu":"szintvonal","en":"a line on a map joining points of equal elevation above sea level","ex":"Closely spaced contour lines told us the climb would be steep.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A szorosan futó szintvonalak jelezték, hogy a mászás meredek lesz."},
{"t":"declination","cat":"navigáció","hu":"mágneses elhajlás, deklináció","en":"the angular difference between magnetic north and grid or true north","ex":"The declination in this area is small, but ignore it and you will miss the checkpoint.","abbr":"grid-magnetic angle / GMA","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A mágneses elhajlás ezen a területen kicsi, de ha figyelmen kívül hagyod, elvéted az ellenőrzőpontot."},
{"t":"grid north","cat":"navigáció","hu":"hálózati észak","en":"the direction of the vertical grid lines on a map","ex":"Convert your grid north bearing before setting it on the compass.","abbr":"GN","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Számítsd át a hálózati északhoz viszonyított irányszöget, mielőtt beállítod a tájolón."},
{"t":"high ground","cat":"navigáció","hu":"magaslat, uralgó terep","en":"elevated terrain that gives observation and fields of fire over the surrounding area","ex":"Whoever holds the high ground can observe every road into the town.","abbr":"dominating ground","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Aki a magaslatot tartja, minden, a városba vezető utat megfigyelhet."},
{"t":"magnetic north","cat":"navigáció","hu":"mágneses észak","en":"the direction a compass needle points, towards the magnetic pole","ex":"Remember that the compass shows magnetic north, not the grid lines on the map.","abbr":"MN","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Ne feledd, hogy a tájoló a mágneses északot mutatja, nem a térkép hálózati vonalait."},
{"t":"pace count","cat":"navigáció","hu":"lépésszámlálás, lépésmérték","en":"the number of paces a person takes to cover a set distance, used to measure ground on foot","ex":"My pace count is 62 double paces per 100 metres on flat ground.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A lépésmértékem sík terepen 62 dupla lépés 100 méterenként."},
{"t":"re-entrant","cat":"navigáció","hu":"völgybevágás, beszögellés","en":"a small valley or draw running into a ridge, shown by contour lines pointing uphill","ex":"The section used the re-entrant to approach the position out of sight.","abbr":"draw","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A raj a völgybevágást használta, hogy rejtve közelítse meg az állást."},
{"t":"ridge","cat":"navigáció","hu":"gerinc, hegyhát","en":"a long, narrow elevation with sloping sides","ex":"The patrol moved just below the ridge to avoid being silhouetted.","abbr":"ridgeline","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A járőr a gerinc alatt haladt, hogy ne rajzolódjon ki sziluettként."},
{"t":"route reconnaissance","cat":"navigáció","hu":"útvonal-felderítés","en":"reconnaissance to obtain information about a specific route and the terrain alongside it","ex":"The engineers carried out a route reconnaissance to check the bridges for load capacity.","abbr":"route recce","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A műszakiak útvonal-felderítést hajtottak végre, hogy ellenőrizzék a hidak teherbírását."},
{"t":"saddle","cat":"navigáció","hu":"nyereg","en":"a dip or low point along a ridge between two higher points","ex":"We crossed the ridge at the saddle to stay out of the wind.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A gerincen a nyeregnél keltünk át, hogy védve legyünk a széltől."},
{"t":"spur","cat":"navigáció","hu":"hegyorr, kiszögellés","en":"a short, continuous sloping line of higher ground projecting from a ridge","ex":"The enemy machine gun was sited on the spur overlooking the track.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az ellenséges géppuska az utat uraló hegyorron volt telepítve."},
{"t":"waypoint","cat":"navigáció","hu":"útpont","en":"an intermediate reference point along a route, often stored in a GPS","ex":"We loaded five waypoints into the GPS before setting out.","abbr":"WP","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Öt útpontot töltöttünk be a GPS-be indulás előtt."},
{"t":"armistice","cat":"hadijog","hu":"fegyverszünet","en":"a formal agreement between warring parties to stop fighting, often pending a peace treaty","ex":"The armistice was signed at eleven o'clock on the eleventh of November.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A fegyverszünetet november tizenegyedikén, tizenegy órakor írták alá."},
{"t":"combatant","cat":"hadijog","hu":"harcoló, kombattáns","en":"a member of the armed forces entitled to take part directly in hostilities","ex":"Only combatants may lawfully be targeted during an armed conflict.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Fegyveres összeütközés során jogszerűen csak harcolók (kombattánsok) lehetnek célpontok."},
{"t":"embargo","cat":"hadijog","hu":"embargó, kereskedelmi tilalom","en":"an official ban on trade, especially in weapons, with a particular country","ex":"The UN imposed an arms embargo on both sides in the civil war.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az ENSZ fegyverembargót vezetett be a polgárháború mindkét oldalára."},
{"t":"humanitarian corridor","cat":"hadijog","hu":"humanitárius folyosó","en":"an agreed route allowing civilians to leave or aid to enter a conflict zone safely","ex":"A humanitarian corridor allowed thousands of residents to flee the encircled city.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Egy humanitárius folyosó lehetővé tette, hogy több ezer lakos elmeneküljön a bekerített városból."},
{"t":"mercenary","cat":"hadijog","hu":"zsoldos","en":"a soldier hired to fight for a foreign army chiefly for private gain, without POW protection","ex":"Mercenaries captured in the fighting are not entitled to prisoner of war status.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A harcok során elfogott zsoldosokat nem illeti meg a hadifogoly-státusz."},
{"t":"neutrality","cat":"hadijog","hu":"semlegesség","en":"the legal status of a state that does not take part in a war between others","ex":"Switzerland has maintained its neutrality through two world wars.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Svájc két világháborún át megőrizte semlegességét."},
{"t":"non-combatant","cat":"hadijog","hu":"nem harcoló (személy)","en":"a person not taking part in hostilities, such as a civilian, medic or chaplain","ex":"Non-combatants must be protected from deliberate attack at all times.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A nem harcoló személyeket mindig védeni kell a szándékos támadásokkal szemben."},
{"t":"surrender","cat":"hadijog","hu":"megadás, kapituláció","en":"to stop fighting and submit to the enemy's authority","ex":"The garrison surrendered after a siege lasting three weeks.","abbr":"capitulation","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A helyőrség három hetes ostrom után megadta magát."},
{"t":"treaty","cat":"hadijog","hu":"nemzetközi szerződés, egyezmény","en":"a formal, binding agreement between states under international law","ex":"The treaty banned the production and use of chemical weapons.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A szerződés betiltotta a vegyi fegyverek gyártását és használatát."},
{"t":"truce","cat":"hadijog","hu":"fegyvernyugvás, ideiglenes tűzszünet","en":"a temporary, often informal, halt to fighting agreed by both sides","ex":"A brief truce allowed both sides to collect their dead.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Egy rövid fegyvernyugvás lehetővé tette mindkét oldalnak, hogy összegyűjtse halottait."},
{"t":"war crime","cat":"hadijog","hu":"háborús bűncselekmény","en":"a serious violation of the laws of war giving rise to individual criminal responsibility","ex":"The tribunal convicted the general of war crimes committed during the siege.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A törvényszék háborús bűncselekmények elkövetése miatt ítélte el a tábornokot, amelyeket az ostrom alatt követett el."},
{"t":"white flag","cat":"hadijog","hu":"fehér zászló","en":"a flag used to signal surrender or a wish to negotiate under protection","ex":"Two soldiers approached under a white flag to request a ceasefire.","abbr":"flag of truce","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Két katona fehér zászló alatt közeledett, hogy tűzszünetet kérjen."},
{"t":"air-gapped","cat":"kiber","hu":"hálózatról fizikailag leválasztott","en":"physically isolated from unsecured networks such as the internet","ex":"The weapons control system is air-gapped to keep hackers out.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A fegyverirányító rendszer hálózatról fizikailag le van választva, hogy távol tartsa a hackereket."},
{"t":"breach","cat":"kiber","hu":"biztonsági rés, betörés (rendszerbe)","en":"an incident in which security is broken and data or systems are accessed without authorisation","ex":"The breach exposed the personal records of thousands of service members.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A biztonsági rés több ezer szolgálati személy személyes adatait tárta fel."},
{"t":"cyber attack","cat":"kiber","hu":"kibertámadás","en":"a deliberate attempt to damage, disrupt or gain access to computer systems or networks","ex":"A cyber attack knocked out the power grid for several hours.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Egy kibertámadás órákra megbénította az áramhálózatot."},
{"t":"cyber defence","cat":"kiber","hu":"kibervédelem","en":"measures taken to protect military networks and systems from hostile digital activity","ex":"The alliance has made cyber defence a core part of collective security.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A szövetség a kibervédelmet a kollektív biztonság alapvető részévé tette."},
{"t":"disinformation","cat":"kiber","hu":"dezinformáció, félretájékoztatás","en":"false information deliberately spread to deceive and influence opinion","ex":"A wave of disinformation blamed the attack on the wrong country.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A dezinformáció hulláma rossz országot vádolt a támadással."},
{"t":"hardened","cat":"kiber","hu":"megerősített, védetté tett (rendszer, létesítmény)","en":"made resistant to attack, whether by physical protection or by removing digital vulnerabilities","ex":"Only hardened systems are allowed to connect to the command network.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Csak megerősített (védetté tett) rendszerek csatlakozhatnak a parancsnoki hálózathoz."},
{"t":"intrusion","cat":"kiber","hu":"behatolás (hálózatba)","en":"unauthorised entry into a computer system or network","ex":"Analysts detected the intrusion only after data had been leaving the network for months.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az elemzők csak hónapokkal azután észlelték a behatolást, hogy adatok szivárogtak ki a hálózatból."},
{"t":"jamming","cat":"kiber","hu":"zavarás (rádió-, radar-)","en":"deliberately interfering with radio, radar or GPS signals to render them useless","ex":"GPS jamming forced the drones to navigate by other means.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A GPS-zavarás arra kényszerítette a drónokat, hogy más módon navigáljanak."},
{"t":"malware","cat":"kiber","hu":"kártékony szoftver, rosszindulatú program","en":"software designed to damage, disrupt or gain unauthorised access to a computer system","ex":"The malware spread through the network via an infected email attachment.","abbr":"malicious software","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A kártékony szoftver egy fertőzött e-mail-mellékleten keresztül terjedt a hálózatban."},
{"t":"phishing","cat":"kiber","hu":"adathalászat","en":"fraudulent messages designed to trick users into revealing passwords or installing malware","ex":"A phishing email disguised as a pay notice compromised several officers' accounts.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Egy fizetési értesítőnek álcázott adathalász e-mail több tiszt fiókját is feltörte."},
{"t":"contact report","cat":"parancsformátum","hu":"harcérintkezési jelentés","en":"an immediate report sent when a unit engages or is engaged by the enemy","ex":"The contact report gave the grid, direction and estimated strength of the enemy.","abbr":"CONTACTREP","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A harcérintkezési jelentés megadta az ellenség rácskoordinátáit, irányát és becsült létszámát."},
{"t":"D-day","cat":"parancsformátum","hu":"D-nap (a művelet kezdőnapja)","en":"the unnamed day on which an operation commences, used for planning before the date is fixed","ex":"The rehearsal was scheduled for D-day minus two at the training area.","abbr":"D","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A próbát D-nap mínusz kettőre tervezték a kiképzési területen."},
{"t":"H-hour","cat":"parancsformátum","hu":"H-óra (a művelet kezdetének időpontja)","en":"the specific time at which an operation or assault begins","ex":"All units were to cross the line of departure at H-hour minus ten.","abbr":"H-hr","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Minden alegységnek H-óra mínusz tíznél kellett átlépnie a kiindulási vonalat."},
{"t":"mission","cat":"parancsformátum","hu":"feladat (a parancs 2. pontja)","en":"paragraph two of an OPORD: a clear statement of who, what, when, where and why","ex":"The mission was read twice so that every section commander could write it down.","abbr":"para 2","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A feladatot kétszer olvasták fel, hogy minden rajparancsnok le tudja jegyezni."},
{"t":"no later than","cat":"parancsformátum","hu":"legkésőbb (határidő)","en":"a deadline expression in orders indicating the latest acceptable time for an action","ex":"Be prepared to move no later than 0430 with full combat load.","abbr":"NLT","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Legyenek felkészülve az indulásra legkésőbb 0430-kor, teljes harci felszereléssel."},
{"t":"phase line","cat":"parancsformátum","hu":"terepszakasz, fázisvonal","en":"a line used to control and coordinate operations, usually following a recognisable terrain feature","ex":"Report when you cross phase line Blue and again at phase line Green.","abbr":"PL","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Jelentse, amikor átlépi a Kék fázisvonalat, majd újra a Zöld fázisvonalnál."},
{"t":"situation","cat":"parancsformátum","hu":"helyzet (a parancs 1. pontja)","en":"paragraph one of an OPORD, describing enemy forces, friendly forces and attachments","ex":"Under 'situation', the S2 briefed enemy strength and likely courses of action.","abbr":"para 1","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A \"helyzet\" pont alatt az S2 eligazítást tartott az ellenség létszámáról és a valószínű cselekvési lehetőségeiről."},
{"t":"spot report","cat":"parancsformátum","hu":"észlelési jelentés","en":"a brief, timely report of enemy activity or other significant information observed","ex":"The scout sent a spot report on three armoured vehicles refuelling at the crossroads.","abbr":"SPOTREP","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A felderítő észlelési jelentést küldött három páncélozott járműről, amelyek a keresztútnál tankoltak."},
{"t":"warning order","cat":"parancsformátum","hu":"előzetes intézkedés, előzetes parancs","en":"a preliminary notice of an upcoming order or action, allowing units to begin preparation","ex":"A warning order went out at midnight so the platoons could start battle preparation.","abbr":"WARNO / WngO","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Éjfélkor kiadták az előzetes intézkedést, hogy a szakaszok megkezdhessék a harcra való felkészülést."},
{"t":"after-action review","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"művelet utáni értékelés, gyakorlat utáni kiértékelés","en":"a structured discussion held after an exercise or operation to identify lessons","ex":"The after-action review highlighted poor radio discipline during the attack.","abbr":"AAR","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A gyakorlat utáni kiértékelés kiemelte a gyenge rádiófegyelmet a támadás során."},
{"t":"assault course","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"akadálypálya","en":"a course of obstacles used to train soldiers in agility, strength and teamwork","ex":"The platoon completed the assault course in full kit in under nine minutes.","abbr":"obstacle course","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A szakasz kilenc percen belül teljesítette az akadálypályát teljes felszerelésben."},
{"t":"basic training","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"alapkiképzés","en":"the initial period of military training that teaches recruits fundamental soldiering skills","ex":"Basic training covers drill, weapons handling, fitness and fieldcraft.","abbr":"BT","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az alapkiképzés kiterjed az alaki kiképzésre, a fegyverkezelésre, a fizikai állóképességre és a terepismeretre."},
{"t":"boot camp","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"újonckiképzés, alapkiképző tábor","en":"an intensive initial training course for new recruits, especially in the US forces","ex":"Recruits spend thirteen weeks at boot camp before joining their units.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az újoncok tizenhárom hetet töltenek az alapkiképző táborban, mielőtt csatlakoznának egységeikhez."},
{"t":"briefing","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"eligazítás","en":"a meeting at which information and instructions are given before a task or mission","ex":"The briefing covered the route, the threat and the timings for the patrol.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az eligazítás kitért az útvonalra, a fenyegetésre és a járőrözés időzítésére."},
{"t":"cadet","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"tisztjelölt, hadapród, kadét","en":"a trainee officer at a military academy","ex":"The cadets paraded in front of their families on graduation day.","abbr":"OCdt (officer cadet)","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A tisztjelöltek a családjaik előtt vonultak fel a végzés napján."},
{"t":"drill instructor","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"kiképző altiszt","en":"a non-commissioned officer responsible for training recruits","ex":"The drill instructor bellowed at the recruits from the moment they arrived.","abbr":"DI / drill sergeant","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A kiképző altiszt attól a pillanattól kezdve ordítozott az újoncokkal, hogy megérkeztek."},
{"t":"dry run","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"száraz gyakorlás, próba (éles lőszer nélkül)","en":"a practice of a procedure without live ammunition or real consequences","ex":"They did a dry run of the assault before rehearsing it with live rounds.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Száraz gyakorlást tartottak a rohamról, mielőtt éles lőszerrel is begyakorolták volna."},
{"t":"field exercise","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"terepgyakorlat","en":"a training exercise conducted outdoors under realistic operational conditions","ex":"The battalion spent ten days on a field exercise in the mountains.","abbr":"FTX","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A zászlóalj tíz napot töltött terepgyakorlaton a hegyekben."},
{"t":"firing range","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"lőtér","en":"an area designed for practising shooting safely","ex":"The company spent the day on the firing range zeroing their rifles.","abbr":"range","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A század a napot a lőtéren töltötte, a puskáikat belőve."},
{"t":"live-fire exercise","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"éleslövészet, éleslövészettel egybekötött gyakorlat","en":"a training exercise in which real ammunition is used","ex":"Safety staff monitored every stage of the live-fire exercise.","abbr":"LFX","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A biztonsági személyzet az éleslövészet minden szakaszát felügyelte."},
{"t":"marksmanship","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"lövészeti tudás, céllövő képesség","en":"skill in shooting accurately with a firearm","ex":"Marksmanship is tested annually on the range with the service rifle.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A lövészeti tudást évente tesztelik a lőtéren a rendszeresített puskával."},
{"t":"passing-out parade","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"kiképzést záró díszszemle, avatás","en":"a ceremonial parade marking the completion of basic or officer training","ex":"Her parents travelled from abroad to watch the passing-out parade.","abbr":"graduation parade","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A szülei külföldről utaztak, hogy megnézzék a kiképzést záró díszszemlét."},
{"t":"physical training","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"testnevelés, fizikai kiképzés","en":"organised exercise sessions to build and maintain soldiers' fitness","ex":"Physical training starts at six every morning, regardless of the weather.","abbr":"PT","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A fizikai kiképzés minden reggel hatkor kezdődik, az időjárástól függetlenül."},
{"t":"qualification","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"minősítés, minősítő vizsga","en":"a formal test confirming that a soldier meets the required standard in a skill","ex":"Every soldier must pass weapons qualification before deploying.","abbr":"qual","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Minden katonának teljesítenie kell a fegyverminősítést a bevetés előtt."},
{"t":"recruit","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"újonc","en":"a person who has recently joined the armed forces and is undergoing initial training","ex":"The recruits were issued their uniforms on the first morning.","abbr":"","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"Az újoncok az első reggel kapták meg az egyenruhájukat."},
{"t":"rehearsal","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"begyakorlás, művelet előtti próba","en":"a practice run of a planned operation to ensure everyone knows their role","ex":"The full-scale rehearsal took place on a mock-up of the target compound.","abbr":"ROC drill","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A teljes körű begyakorlás a célépület makettjén zajlott."},
{"t":"simulation","cat":"kiképzés","hu":"szimuláció","en":"training using computer or physical models that imitate real operations","ex":"Pilots practise emergency procedures in the simulation before flying the real aircraft.","abbr":"sim","lvl":"B2","ex_hu":"A pilóták a szimulációban gyakorolják a vészhelyzeti eljárásokat, mielőtt a valódi repülőgéppel repülnének."}
